\code{created_RICA_variable} are variable names that are \strong{not directly available} in source French FADN
but \strong{must be derived} (e.g., computed from other columns, pivoting the French RICA crop table longer, etc.).
For instance, in the French RICA, the crop table has a crop code and a area variable. This table is pivot longer, and
the \code{created_RICA_variable} name for wheat area is \verb{111_SUPER3}, combining the wheat code \code{111}
to the area variable name \code{SUPER3}. The same approach is implemented for the livestock table.
